frequently hit by

6
00:00:02,431 --> 00:00:02,775
strong winds

7
00:00:02,775 --> 00:00:03,119
and earthquakes.

8
00:00:03,143 --> 00:00:03,652
He started by

9
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:03,991
connecting massive

10
00:00:03,991 --> 00:00:04,330
steel columns

11
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:04,669
to form

12
00:00:04,669 --> 00:00:05,008
a structural

13
00:00:05,008 --> 00:00:05,177
framework,

14
00:00:05,177 --> 00:00:05,516
then built

15
00:00:05,516 --> 00:00:05,855
the skyscraper

16
00:00:05,855 --> 00:00:06,194
one floor

17
00:00:06,194 --> 00:00:06,703
at a time.

18
00:00:06,727 --> 00:00:07,075
But once

19
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:07,423
the building

20
00:00:07,423 --> 00:00:07,771
was completed,

21
00:00:07,771 --> 00:00:08,118
