24
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:09,162
to sway

25
00:00:09,162 --> 00:00:09,684
back and forth,

26
00:00:09,684 --> 00:00:10,031
shaking everything

27
00:00:10,031 --> 00:00:10,205
inside.

28
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:10,760
He immediately added

29
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,290
diagonal steel braces

30
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:11,644
to make

31
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:11,998
the structure

32
00:00:11,998 --> 00:00:12,351
more rigid.

33
00:00:12,376 --> 00:00:12,854
The building became

34
00:00:12,854 --> 00:00:13,173
more stable,

35
00:00:13,173 --> 00:00:13,810
but it still swayed

36
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:14,288
enough to make

37
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:14,607
people inside

38
00:00:14,607 --> 00:00:14,766
uncomfortable.

39
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:15,064
That's when

40
00:00:15,064 --> 00:00:15,611
he came up with

41
00:00:15,611 --> 00:00:16,021
an unusual solution.

42
00:00:16,046 --> 00:00:16,378
He installed

43
00:00:16,378 --> 00:00:16,710
a massive

44
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:17,042
steel sphere

45
00:00:17,042 --> 00:00:17,540
near the top

46
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,039
of the skyscraper,

47
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:18,537
suspended it from

48
00:00:18,537 --> 00:00:18,703
heavy-duty

49
00:00:18,703 --> 00:00:19,035
steel cables,

50
00:00:19,035 --> 00:00:19,534
and connected it

51
00:00:19,534 --> 00:00:20,032
to a series

52
00:00:20,032 --> 00:00:20,364
of dampers.

53
00:00:20,388 --> 00:00:20,831
When the wind

54
00:00:20,831 --> 00:00:21,273
pushed the building

55
00:00:21,273 --> 00:00:21,715
to the left,

56
00:00:21,715 --> 00:00:22,010
inertia caused

57
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:22,305
the sphere

58
00:00:22,305 --> 00:00:22,600
to resist

59
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:22,895
the movement,

60
00:00:22,895 --> 00:00:23,337
making it move

61
00:00:23,337 --> 00:00:23,632
in the

62
00:00:23,632 --> 00:00:23,927
opposite direction

63
00:00:23,927 --> 00:00:24,222
relative to

64
00:00:24,222 --> 00:00:24,517
the building.

65
00:00:24,541 --> 00:00:25,065
As the building

66
00:00:25,065 --> 00:00:25,415
changed direction,

67
00:00:25,415 --> 00:00:25,939
the sphere continued

68
00:00:25,939 --> 00:00:26,637
